WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.600
Reporter: Was the queue at Gate 4 dangerous today?

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:10.600
Faisal: Welcome. I can't comment, but our media team can help - the media centre is that way.

3
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:19.900
Narrator: Faisal's good answer is polite, short and helpful: no comment, a referral to the media team, and a quick word to his supervisor.

